    <string name="app_name">Health Connect Bridge</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Privacy policy\n\nHealth Connect Bridge has read-only access to the Health Connect data you allow (heart rate, steps, calories, sleep, exercise and more). It sends that data only to the server you configure.\n\nNothing goes to third parties. The app collects no usage statistics. You can revoke access at any time in Health Connect settings.</string>

